{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43173","headline":"折杨柳 · 欧阳瑾","name":"折杨柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"垂柳拂妆台，葳蕤叶半开。\n年华枝上见，边思曲中来。\n嫩色宜新雨，轻花伴落梅。\n朝朝倦攀折，征戍几时回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳瑾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}